    "reconciliation_notes": [
      "FY illustrative gross GAAP CAS estimate and co-product sales credits are independent of the published rounded by-product unit metrics. (8,610 - 4,180) / 4,900 × 1,000 = $904/oz, versus $925/oz directly guided. The Q4 residual gives approximately $1,197/oz versus $1,250/oz directly guided. These differences remain visible without changing the filed/guided inputs.",
      "For actuals, the by-product CAS calculation deducts net other-metal sales. By-product AISC deducts other-metal sales before treatment and refining to avoid repeating charges already included in AISC. The FY management reconciliation shows its own published net-sales deduction and is recorded as presented.",
      "AISC includes sustaining capital, lease payments, selected reclamation costs, corporate overhead and other items. It is a non-GAAP operating KPI and cannot replace the GAAP CAS line or cash flow from operations."
    ]
